Sentence 3: The Pequeno entered the AKC Misc class in January 2011 and entered the Hound Class in January 2013.
Sentence 4: The Portuguese Podengo Pequeno is characterized by a wedge shaped head, with erect ears and a curved tail.
Sentence 5: The AKC breed standards include the following points: Podengo Pequeno are small, friendly, hardy, lively and intelligent companions.
Sentence 6: In Europe, the Podengo is classified by the Fédération Cynologique Internationale (FCI) as Group 5: Spitz and primitive type, Section 7: Primitive type hunting dogs.
Sentence 7: There are three sizes of Podengos: Podengo Pequeno, Podengo Medio and Podengo Grande.
