Sentence 2: Numbering only 200 warriors, the Nez Perce battled some 2,000 American regulars and volunteers in a total of eighteen engagements, including four major battles and at least four fiercely contested skirmishes."
Sentence 3: The Nez Perce were finally surrounded at the Battle of Bear Paw and surrendered.
