Sentence 5: In this case a parlay has much higher expected returns than individual bets but unfortunately greatly increased variance in outcomes.
Sentence 6: Parlay (gambling) A parlay, accumulator, or combo bet is a single bet that links together two or more individual wagers and is dependent on all of those wagers winning together.
Sentence 7: The benefit of the parlay is that there are much higher payoffs than placing each individual bet separately, since the difficulty of hitting all of them is much higher.
Sentence 8: If any of the bets in the parlay lose, the entire parlay loses.
